    </contentBlocks>
    <category>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Awards & Certifications]]></Value>
    </category>
    <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[We are proud to announce that Centro, a global business process outsourcing company headquartered in the US, has officially obtained its license from the National Telecom Regulatory Authority (NTRA), a key milestone that reinforces our ongoing commitment to compliance, service excellence, and sustainable growth in Egypt's telecommunications sector.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
